Facet online adaptation

This distribution contains curated neural-network, replay-buffer and RL-token
components from the authors' deployed RLT/OpenPI online adaptation implementation.
See docs/provenance.json for file hashes and docs/curation.md for the scope of changes.

OpenPI is developed by Physical Intelligence and licensed under Apache-2.0.
OpenPI and its websocket client are external dependencies, not vendored here.
UR RTDE, RealSense, SpaceMouse, ROS and Franka controllers are external dependencies
and retain their respective licenses. This package does not include model weights,
training datasets, private task calibrations, or experiment artifacts.
